This laboratory was completed as part of the **Machine Learning Laboratory** course to develop practical skills in applying One-Dimensional Convolutional Neural Networks (1D CNNs) for time-series forecasting. The techniques introduced in this lab demonstrate how convolutional architectures can effectively learn temporal patterns from sequential data, providing a strong foundation for more advanced sequence models such as Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) networks.

